  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation Y.3600 provides requirements, capabilities and use cases of cloudcomputing based big data as well as its system context. Cloud computing based big data provides the capabilities to collect, store, analyze,visualize and manage varieties of large volume datasets,which cannot be rapidlytransferred and analysed using traditionaltechnologies. </abstract>
